     "page": 2,
     "text": "has been advised to continue her current treatment plan and maintain regular follow-ups.\n\nJanuary 19, 2024: \nJennifer visited for a flu shot and routine check-up. Her blood pressure was 134/87, and she weighed 173 pounds. She continues to manage her Polycystic kidney disease (eGFR 52) and her Peripheral arterial disease with an aortic aneurysm (AAA; 4 cm) well.\n"
